---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Delete your Pillar account"
  description="Request deletion of your Pillar account in the app or by email."
  path="/account-deletion"
>
  <article class="prose-pillar" style="max-width: 760px;">
    <h1>Delete your Pillar account</h1>
    <p>You can request deletion of your Pillar account and associated data in the app or by email.</p>

    <h2>In the app</h2>
    <p>Tap <strong>Delete Account</strong> in Pillar.</p>

    <h2>By email</h2>
    <p>
      Email <a href="mailto:getinclined@gmail.com?subject=Delete%20my%20Pillar%20account">getinclined@gmail.com</a>{' '}
      with the subject “Delete my Pillar account”. Include your unique username if you know it;
      you can find it on the Profile page in the app.
    </p>
    <p>If you no longer have access to the app or do not know your username, email us anyway to request deletion.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
